# Local docs / planning artifacts
docs/*
# Facts sheets are pipeline state, not local scratch: a headless run must be able to push one
# so the next run picks up where it left off.
!docs/facts-review/
# Scorecards and calibration reports are the same kind of state, and 15 of the 20 files in here
# were already tracked before this line existed - the ignore rule had stopped matching reality.
# A scorecard is how the next run knows what a page last scored and why; a calibration report is
# how drift gets spotted. Both are worthless if they only exist on one machine.
!docs/reviews/
